rsvce_text:
R/. With the Lord there is mercy, and fullness of redemption.

Out of the depths I cry to thee, O LORD! Lord, hear my voice! Let thy ears be attentive to the voice of my supplications! If thou, O LORD, shouldst mark iniquities, Lord, who could stand? But there is forgiveness with thee, that thou mayest be feared. I wait for the LORD, my soul waits, and in his word I hope;

R/. With the Lord there is mercy, and fullness of redemption.

