or:  Alleluia.

R/. The upright shall behold your face, O Lord. Or: Alleluia.

The Lord is in his holy temple;
the throne of the Lord is in heaven.
His eyes behold the world;
his gaze probes the children of men.

R/. The upright shall behold your face, O Lord. Or: Alleluia.

