R/. Blessed are the poor in spirit;

Of those who trust in their wealth and boast of their abundant riches? No man can ransom even a brother, or pay to God his own ransom. The redemption of his soul is costly; and he will pass away forever.

R/. Blessed are the poor in spirit;

Selah Do not fear when a man becomes rich, when the wealth of his house grows great.

R/. Blessed are the poor in spirit;

At his death he will not take along anything, his glory will not go down after him. During his life his soul uttered blessings; “They will praise you, for you do well for yourself.”

R/. Blessed are the poor in spirit;

